        "title": "Immune Evasion Strategies",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Every successful human pathogen has evolved mechanisms to defeat or evade at least\nsome arm of the immune response. Understanding evasion explains why some viruses\ncause chronic infections, why some escape vaccines, and why cytokine storms occur\n(immune response overreacts to compensate for virus evasion)."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-IMMUNE-EVASION.md#003",
      "path": [
        "05-IMMUNE-EVASION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:virology:05-immune-evasion, git-history:virology:05-immune-evasion]",
        "canonical_path": "virology/05-IMMUNE-EVASION.md",
        "concepts": "[immune, evasion]",
        "current_path": "virology/05-IMMUNE-EVASION.md",
        "id": "maxim:virology:immune-evasion",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "virology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[immune, evasion]",
        "section": "virology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Immune Evasion Strategies",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                IMMUNE EVASION — FULL LANDSCAPE                   │\n│                                                                  │\n│  TARGET         EVASION STRATEGY                  EXAMPLES       │\n│  ─────────      ─────────────────                 ────────       │\n│  Innate         Block IFN induction               Flu NS1        │\n│  sensing        Degrade sensing molecules         SARS PLpro     │\n│                 Sequester dsRNA from RIG-I        Corona DMVs    │\n│                 cGAS/STING inhibition             Adenovirus E1A │\n│                                                                  │\n│  IFN signaling  Block JAK-STAT pwy               Paramyxovirus V │\n│                 Degrade STAT1/STAT2               Simian virus 5 │\n│                                                                  │\n│  MHC-I          Downregulate MHC-I                HIV Nef, HCMV  │\n│  presentation   Block TAP (peptide transport)     HSV ICP47      │\n│                 Retain MHC-I in ER/Golgi          HCMV US2/US11  │\n│                                                                  │\n│  CTL killing    Prevent apoptosis                 EBV BHRF1/FLIP │\n│                 Target NK cell sensors            HCMV UL18      │\n│                                                                  │\n│  Antibodies     Antigenic variation               gp120 glycan   │\n│                 Decoy antigens                    HIV shed gp120 │\n│                 Structural shielding              Sialylation    │\n│                                                                  │\n│  Complement     Complement regulators             HSV gC, EBV    │\n│                                                                  │\n│  Latency        Hide genome in resting cells      HSV, EBV, HIV  │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"
    },
