      },
      "text": "### Blocking IFN Signaling"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-IMMUNE-EVASION.md#012",
      "path": [
        "05-IMMUNE-EVASION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:virology:05-immune-evasion, git-history:virology:05-immune-evasion]",
        "canonical_path": "virology/05-IMMUNE-EVASION.md",
